l21: $ … ⇒ kc_lit = kc_lit ∧ ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ = ⟨ x1 +: ∅ , x2 ⟩ $ by opair_inj_c [and_elim_r [l16], l18, l19, l18, l20]
