l35: $ G , ⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩ , ⟨ o , p ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ x0 , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ x1 +: ∅ , x2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' x1)) ⟩ ⇒ ∅ = ∅ $ by eq_refl
