l37: $ … ⇒ ⟨ o , p ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ x1 +: ∅ , x2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' x1)) ⟩ $ by eq_subst [eq_sym [l29], l5]
l38: $ … ⇒ ⟨ o , p ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , x2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩ $ by eq_subst [eq_sym [l36], l37]
l39: $ … ⇒ ⟨ o , p ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩ $ by eq_subst [eq_sym [l30], l38]
l40: $ … ⇒ ⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ o , p ⟩ $ by eq_trans [l4, eq_sym [l39]]
l41: $ … ⇒ t = p $ by opair_inj_r [l40]
l42: $ G , ⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩ , ∃ x2 (⟨ o , p ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ x0 , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ x1 +: ∅ , x2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' x1)) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ x2 (⟨ o , p ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ x0 , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ x1 +: ∅ , x2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' x1)) ⟩) $ by ax
l43: $ … ⇒ t = p $ by ex_elim [l42, l41]
l44: $ G , ⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩ , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 (⟨ o , p ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ x0 , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ x1 +: ∅ , x2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' x1)) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 (⟨ o , p ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ x0 , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ x1 +: ∅ , x2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' x1)) ⟩) $ by ax
l45: $ … ⇒ t = p $ by ex_elim [l44, l43]
l46: $ G , ⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩ ⇒ t = p $ by ex_elim [l3, l45]
l47: $ G , ∃ e (⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ e (⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩) $ by ax
