l49: $ G , ∃ l ∃ e (⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ l ∃ e (⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ l +: ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , (λₛ w ∈ lvals, sclip (nnf' nvf' l)) ⟩) $ by ax
