lemma f214_g_hty (G: hyps) (o t p: set): $ G ⇒ ⟨ o , t ⟩ ∈ hty $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hfin $ > $ G ⇒ t = p $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ hfin ⊆ hty ∪ (hctor ∪ (hrec ∪ (hlit ∪ hcst))) $ by subset_refl
l2: $ … ⇒ ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hty ∪ (hctor ∪ (hrec ∪ (hlit ∪ hcst))) $ by wcel_subset [l1, #2]
l3: $ … ⇒ ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hty ∨ ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hctor ∪ (hrec ∪ (hlit ∪ hcst)) $ by f214_un [l2]
l4: $ G , ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hty ⇒ ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hty $ by ax
l5: $ G , ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hty ⇒ ⟨ o , t ⟩ ∈ hty $ by weaken [#1]
l6: $ G , ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hty ⇒ functional hty $ by hty_functional
l7: $ … ⇒ t = p $ by functional_elim [l6, l5, l4]
l8: $ G , ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hctor ∪ (hrec ∪ (hlit ∪ hcst)) ⇒ ⟨ o , p ⟩ ∈ hctor ∪ (hrec ∪ (hlit ∪ hcst)) $ by ax
